DofusMirror
==========

This product includes software developed by the TouchMirror project
(https://github.com/shinzarou-eng/TouchMirror), licensed under the MIT
License, from which DofusMirror's Android mirroring engine usage and
protocol design are derived.

The bundled Android engine (assets/engine.jar) is a fork of
scrcpy-server (https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Copyright 2018-2022 Genymobile and scrcpy contributors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The engine jar is built from the sources in the upstream repository's
engine/ directory and remains subject to the Apache License 2.0.

Local modifications to the engine (built with engine/gradlew :server:assembleRelease):

- audio/AudioSource.java: added MIC, VOICE_RECOGNITION and VOICE_COMMUNICATION
  capture sources alongside the original OUTPUT (REMOTE_SUBMIX).
- Server.java: audio capture now uses AudioSource.MIC by default.

Reason: REMOTE_SUBMIX capture is blocked on Android 15 / HyperOS, producing
silent audio with no packets. MIC capture uses the RECORD_AUDIO permission
available to the adb shell user.

The upstream jar is retained as assets/engine-original.jar for comparison.
